Fits across N (assume E ~ C * N^p)
================================================================================
SO(2N)   E[Lambda(1)^2] ~ 2.1470e+02 * N^+0.058
  (for SO(2N), E|Lambda'(1)|^2 = N^2 * E[L^2] ~ 2.1470e+02 * N^+2.058)

