VERDICT
================================================================================
Reading off leading constants and powers:
  SO(2N)   coeff (Lambda^2):  C ~ 214.7014,  power ~ +0.058
  SO(2N+1) coeff (|Lambda'|^2): C ~ 9.9385, power ~ +2.649

For C2 to pass as user-stated (1/12 unitary baseline + d^{2k}/(2k)!=2/3):
  Need orthogonal coefficient = 1/18 = 0.0556 [if interpreted multiplicatively]
  OR = 1/12 = 0.0833 [if 16/24 already absorbed elsewhere]
Hughes-Snaith standard result for SO(2N+1) derivative 2nd moment:
  predicts power and constant (compute from Barnes G - check arXiv 0707.4129)
